flowchart TB
  S([Start]) --> A[GET /api/collections: the chosen ones,<br/>plus made for you and their own<br/>when logged in]
  A --> B{Tab}
  B -->|All or<br/>Chosen by us| C[/Grid of collections<br/>and this week's show/]
  B -->|Made for you| B1{Logged<br/>in?}
  B1 -->|No| B2[/Log in and we'll put<br/>two together for you/] --> X1([End])
  B1 -->|Yes| C
  C --> D{Visitor}
  D -->|Start a collection| P((A))
  D -->|Opens one| E[GET /api/collections/:slug]
  E --> F{Starts with<br/>for-you-?}
  F -->|Yes| F1[Build it fresh from their taste:<br/>6 paintings from the top room<br/>or with the top colour] --> H
  F -->|No| G{Chosen, or<br/>their own?}
  G -->|No| G1[/404: we could not<br/>find that collection/] --> X2([End])
  G -->|Yes| H[/Entrance: Start the walk,<br/>Save all, Share/]
  H --> I[/The walk: each painting with its note,<br/>and a gold circle where it points/]
  I --> J[/End of the room and the<br/>next chosen collection/] --> X3([End])
